# New reflexive object property triples added where meaningful, without altering existing ontology content.
# These additions declare self-related variants for common symmetric/identity-style relations.
@prefix : <http://example.org/ontology#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .

:isSimilarTo a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:ReflexiveProperty .

:isEquivalentTo a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:ReflexiveProperty .

:isIdenticalTo a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:ReflexiveProperty .

:isSelfRelatedTo a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:ReflexiveProperty .